  "text": "\r\n\t\t Election Results | Windham, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Absentee Voters \r\n\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Voter Information \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElection & Voter Information \nElection Results \r\nElection Results\t\t \r\n2026 \r\nRepublican Primary Complete Results 2026 \r\nDemocratic Primary Complete Results 2026 \r\nTown Election 03102026 updated \r\nZoning Ballot Results 031026 \r\n2025 \r\nWrite In List March 11, 2025 \r\nElection Results Windham Town-School March 11 2025 \r\n2024 \r\nNovember 5 Election Results \r\nRepublican Primary Results 1/23/2024 \r\nDemocratic Primary Results 1/23/2024 \r\nSecretary of State Election Monitor Report January 23, 2024 Presidential Primary \r\nElection 3-12-2024 \r\nRecount Summary \r\nState Primary 9/10/24 Republican Results \r\nState Primary 9/10/24 Democrat Results \r\n2023 \r\nLocal Results \r\nZoning Results \r\n2022 \r\n03/08/2022 Town Ballot Results \r\n03/08/2022 Zoning Ballot Results \r\nState Primary Results \r\nState Primary Monitor Report \r\nNovember General  \r\n2021 \r\n03/09/2021 Town Ballot Results \r\n03/09/2021 Zoning Ballot Results \r\nOn August 23, 2021 , the  NH Ballot Law Commission  released their report (Decision BLC 2021-1) regarding the audit; which can be viewed  here. \r\n2020 General Election Forensic Audit :  The NH SB43 Forensic Audit Report completed by Harri Hursti, Mark Lindeman, and Philip B. Stark is available on the NH Department of Justice website. Please click  here  to visit their SB43 main site for a link to the  report  and other audit related files. \r\n11/03/2020 General Election Results \r\n09/08/2020 Windham State Primary Results \r\n09/08/2020  Republican Primary Results \r